#!/bin/sh
zenity --info --width=500 --title="Welcome" --icon-name=emberos --ok-label="Close" --text="<b>Welcome to EmberOS 3.1</b>

Your apps are in the Start menu, bottom left. The Windows key opens it too.

<b>App Store</b> has thousands of free apps.
<b>Google Chrome</b> and <b>Visual Studio Code</b> install the first time you open them.
<b>Save My Files</b> keeps your files and apps after a restart. It needs a virtual hard disk.

<b>Shortcuts</b>
Windows key + V: clipboard history        Windows key + .: emoji
Windows key + Shift + S: screenshot        F12: drop-down terminal
Windows key + Left/Right: snap a window    Ctrl + Shift + Esc: Task Manager"
